    '|b||Here''s what happened.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1480
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow'
    '|a||It was gone.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1840
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|a||David Cutler and Sarah Reber, who studied it, called it an adverse-selection death spiral, completed in three years.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1qf2kjh'
    '|b||And the first to leave were the young and healthy: those who switched away were, on average, four years younger than those who stayed.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7240
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1izh3nv'
    '|a||To see why it snowballs, shrink it to Harbourtown, with made-up numbers: ten boatyard workers and a health plan they may join or skip.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1q370k6'
    '|a||Each bar is one worker''s expected medical bills for a year, from $1,900 down to $100. Each worker roughly knows their own bar; the insurer can''t see it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:18itk0b'
    '|a||So it charges everyone the average: $1,000.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1kwxdtx'
    '|a||And say each worker would pay up to $300 more than their own bills, for peace of mind.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1ocj9si'
    '|b||Then the three healthiest walk. Bills of $100, $300 or $500 aren''t worth a $1,000 premium.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6920
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:igvza7'
    '|a||Seven costly workers remain, and their average bill is $1,300, so that is the new premium.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1qku2wx'
    '|b||At $1,300 two more leave, and it climbs to $1,500. One more goes, and it settles at $1,600.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7840
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1ev3ewq'
    '|a||Four of ten insured, and nobody cheated.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1qdax97'
    '|a||That''s adverse selection: when buyers know their risk and the price can''t, the price drives out the people who keep it low.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:k6xnom'
    '|a||Four of ten stayed. What decides where a spiral stops, and whether anything survives at all?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6320
      voice: gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy
    '|a||Spread those bills smoothly over the whole boatyard. Across, the share of workers in the plan, costliest first; up, dollars a year.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:3dtoxf'
    '|a||The red line is the premium the plan needs: the average bill of everyone in it. It falls as healthier workers join.':
      mp3: 
