      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:9npb1u'
    '|a||The blue line is what each worker would pay: their own bill plus $300 of peace of mind.':
