      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:18lwv2f'
    '|b||Where will the spiral stop? With these two lines, where does the spiral stop?':
