      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1tsmwn8'
    '|b||The grey line is each worker''s own bill. Everyone values cover above it, so cover for all is worth more than it costs.':
